# Deliberately exclude credentials, telemetry, local databases, VCS, and frontend deps.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!src/**
src/**/__pycache__/
src/**/*.pyc
src/**/*.egg-info/

**/.env*
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.jsonl
**/.aws/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
